msgid "Our support team cancelled your booking at {businessName}, as you asked."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryahagaritse gahunda yawe kuri {businessName}, nk’uko wabisabye."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2073
msgid "Our support team checked a customer in"
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryakiriye umukiriya"

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2083
msgid "Our support team checked you in at {shop} for {serviceName}."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryakwakiriye kuri {shop}, kuri {serviceName}."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2087
msgid "Our support team checked you in for {serviceName}."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryakwakiriye kuri {serviceName}."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:558
msgid "Our support team closed your account, as asked. Your bookings and reviews stay with the shops they belong to, with your name removed. You can make a new account with this email at any time."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryafunze konti yawe, nk’uko wabisabye. Gahunda zawe n’ibitekerezo byawe bigumana n’amaduka bireba, izina ryawe ryakuweho. Ushobora gufungura konti nshya ukoresheje iyi imeyili igihe icyo ari cyo cyose."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2260
msgid "Our support team corrected a missed booking"
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryakosoye gahunda yanditswe ko yabuze"

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:389
msgid "Our support team handed the shop to {email}. You are still in the team, as a manager of every branch."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryeguriye iduka {email}. Uracyari mu itsinda, nk’umuyobozi w’amashami yose."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:374
msgid "Our support team made you the owner. You can now change the team, the payout number and everything else. The old owner is still in the team as a manager — keep them or take them out under Team."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryakugize nyir’iduka. Ubu ushobora guhindura itsinda, nimero yo kwishyurirwaho n’ibindi byose. Nyir’iduka wa mbere aracyari mu itsinda nk’umuyobozi — mugumane cyangwa umukuremo muri Itsinda."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2182
msgid "Our support team marked a booking done"
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryemeje ko gahunda yarangiye"

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:145
msgid "Our support team opened your shop again"
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryongeye gufungura iduka ryawe"

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:137
msgid "Our support team paused your shop"
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryahagaritse iduka ryawe by’agateganyo"

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:464
msgid "Our support team signed you out on every phone and computer. Sign in again with a code sent to this email. If you did not ask for this, reply to us in Help."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryagusohoye kuri telefoni na mudasobwa zose. Ongera winjire ukoresheje kode yoherejwe kuri iyi imeyili. Niba utabisabye, dusubize unyuze mu Bufasha."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:296
msgid "Our support team took {email} out of your team."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryakuye {email} mu itsinda ryawe."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:180
msgid "Our support team took back the invitation for {email}."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryakuyeho ubutumire bwa {email}."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:285
msgid "Our support team took you out of the team, so you can no longer open this shop. If you think this is a mistake, ask the shop’s owner."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ry’ubufasha ryagukuye mu itsinda, bityo ntushobora kongera gufungura iri duka. Niba utekereza ko ari ikosa, baza nyir’iduka."

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:424
msgid "Our team hid a review of one of your branches. It is no longer public, and it no longer counts in your rating."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ryahishe igitekerezo ku rimwe mu mashami yawe. Ntikikigaragara ku bantu bose, kandi ntikikibarwa mu manota yawe."

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:422
msgid "Our team hid your review, so it is no longer public."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ryahishe igitekerezo cyawe, bityo ntikikigaragara ku bantu bose."

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:443
msgid "Our team removed the name shown beside your reviews, so they now show as \"Anonymous\"."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ryakuyeho izina ryagaragaraga iruhande rw’ibitekerezo byawe, bityo ubu bigaragara nka \"Utazwi\"."

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:503
msgid "Our team suspended your shop. While it lasts, new customers cannot find or book with you, and your payments are paused."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ryahagaritse iduka ryawe by’agateganyo. Muri icyo gihe, abakiriya bashya ntibashobora kukubona cyangwa gufata gahunda iwawe, kandi kwishyurwa kwawe kurahagaze."

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:434
msgid "Our team took down one of your stories, so customers no longer see it."
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu ryakuyeho imwe mu nkuru zawe, bityo abakiriya ntibakiyibona."

