#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:1945
msgid "We cancelled this booking on the shop’s side. No deposit had been paid."
msgstr "Twahagaritse iyi gahunda mu izina ry’iduka. Avansi ntiyari yishyuwe."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:1944
msgid "We cancelled this booking on the shop’s side. The customer gets their whole deposit back."
msgstr "Twahagaritse iyi gahunda mu izina ry’iduka. Umukiriya asubizwa avansi ye yose."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2317
msgid "We cancelled your booking, as you asked. As agreed when you booked, the deposit is not given back."
msgstr "Twahagaritse gahunda yawe, nk’uko wabisabye. Nk’uko wabyemeye ufata gahunda, avansi ntisubizwa."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2315
msgid "We cancelled your booking, as you asked. It was more than 24 hours before, so your whole deposit comes back to you."
msgstr "Twahagaritse gahunda yawe nk’uko wabisabye. Hari habura amasaha arenga 24, bityo avansi yawe yose irakugarukira."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2318
msgid "We cancelled your booking, as you asked. No deposit had been paid."
msgstr "Twahagaritse gahunda yawe, nk’uko wabisabye. Avansi ntiyari yishyuwe."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2076
msgid "We checked the customer in for {serviceName} on {when}, because it could not be done in the app. Mark it done when the service is finished, as usual."
msgstr "Twakiriye umukiriya waje kuri {serviceName} ({when}), kuko bitashobokaga muri porogaramu. Nk’uko bisanzwe, emeza ko byarangiye serivisi nirangira."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2131
msgid "We checked the customer in for {serviceName}."
msgstr "Twakiriye umukiriya waje kuri {serviceName}."

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:534
msgid "We checked the number you gave, and your payments now go there. Anything kept while it was being checked goes out with your next payment."
msgstr "Twagenzuye nimero watanze, kandi ubu amafaranga yawe ajya kuri yo. Ayari yarabitswe igihe yagenzurwaga azoherezwa hamwe n’ubwishyu bukurikira."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2399
msgid "We checked with MTN: the deposit did not go through. You can try paying again from the booking."
msgstr "Twabajije MTN: avansi ntiyakunze. Ushobora kongera kugerageza kwishyura uhereye kuri gahunda."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2397
msgid "We checked with MTN: your deposit went through, and the booking is confirmed."
msgstr "Twabajije MTN: avansi yawe yakunze, kandi gahunda yemejwe."

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:627
msgid "We checked your {paper} and it is in order."
msgstr "Twagenzuye {paper} yawe kandi iri mu buryo."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2233
msgid "We corrected {serviceName}: it was marked as missed, but the customer came. It now counts as done."
msgstr "Twakosoye {serviceName}: yari yanditswe ko umukiriya ataje, ariko yaje. Ubu ibarwa nk’iyarangiye."

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:637
msgid "We could not accept the {paper} you uploaded."
msgstr "Ntitwashoboye kwemera {paper} washyizeho."

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:545
msgid "We could not accept the number you gave, so your payments stay paused."
msgstr "Ntitwashoboye kwemera nimero watanze, bityo kwishyurwa bikomeje guhagarikwa by’agateganyo."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2355
msgid "We emailed you a new arrival code. The old one no longer works."
msgstr "Twakoherereje kode nshya yo kugera kuri imeyili. Iya kera ntigikora."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:356
msgid "We made {email} the owner of the shop. The old owner stays in the team as a manager."
msgstr "Twagize {email} nyir’iduka. Nyir’iduka wa mbere aguma mu itsinda nk’umuyobozi."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2169
msgid "We marked {serviceName} as done. The shop is paid for it as usual."
msgstr "Twanditse ko {serviceName} yarangiye. Iduka ryishyurwa nk’uko bisanzwe."

#: src/appointments/appointments.service.ts:2185
msgid "We marked {serviceName} on {when} as done, because it could not be done in the app. Your share of the deposit is paid to you as usual."
msgstr "Twanditse ko {serviceName} ({when}) yarangiye, kuko bitashobokaga muri porogaramu. Uhabwa umugabane wawe kuri avansi nk’uko bisanzwe."

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:383
msgid "We marked your question as solved. If it is not, reply within 14 days and it opens again."
msgstr "Twanditse ko ikibazo cyawe cyakemutse. Niba kitarakemuka, subiza mu minsi 14 maze cyongere gufungurwa."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:130
msgid "We opened your shop again: customers can book it."
msgstr "Twongeye gufungura iduka ryawe: abakiriya bashobora kongera gufata gahunda."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:129
msgid "We paused your shop: no new bookings until it is opened again. Bookings already made still happen."
msgstr "Twahagaritse iduka ryawe by’agateganyo: nta gahunda nshya kugeza ryongeye gufungurwa. Gahunda zamaze gufatwa ziracyakomeza."

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:369
msgid "We replied: {subject}"
msgstr "Twagusubije: {subject}"

#: src/notifications/notification-templates.ts:491
msgid "We reviewed your shop and could not approve it yet."
msgstr "Twasuzumye iduka ryawe, ariko ntitwashoboye kuryemeza ubu."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:239
msgid "We sent the invitation to {email} again. It can be accepted for {days} days."
msgstr "Twongeye koherereza {email} ubutumire. Bushobora kwemerwa mu minsi {days}."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:454
msgid "We signed you out on every phone and computer. Sign in again with a code sent to your email."
msgstr "Twagusohoye kuri telefoni na mudasobwa zose. Ongera winjire ukoresheje kode yoherejwe kuri imeyili yawe."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:274
msgid "We took {email} out of the team. They can no longer open the shop."
msgstr "Twakuye {email} mu itsinda. Ntagishobora gufungura iduka."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:173
msgid "We took back the invitation for {email}. They can no longer join with it."
msgstr "Twakuyeho ubutumire bwa {email}. Ntagishobora kubukoresha ngo yinjire."

